unicode-ranges provides the CMake package and target:

    find_package(unicode_ranges CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(your_target PRIVATE unicode_ranges::unicode_ranges)

The package declares simdutf as a transitive dependency. When the `icu` feature
is enabled, installed headers expose the ICU APIs without a consumer-defined
compile macro.

The optional ICU-backed locale APIs are available through the `icu` feature:

    vcpkg install unicode-ranges[icu]
